  "atomsWithoutReader": "none: every atom used is in _vocabulary.json and was checked (institution kinds against INSTITUTION_KIND_PATTERNS). Off-factsOf atoms used: tier, route, food-source, crime. Disjunction form used (\"institution: temple, monastery\", \"route: isolated, port\", \"terrain: coastal, desert\") per DESIGN §3.2.",
  "readerHazards": [
    "INSTITUTION_KIND_PATTERNS.mill matches the catalogue name \"Access to external mill\" (/\\bmill\\b/): hasInstitution(r, \"mill\") is true for a place with only mill ACCESS (the same false match computeActiveChains freezes).",
    "INSTITUTION_KIND_PATTERNS.tavern misses the catalogue spelling \"Ale house\" (it matches \"Alehouse\" only).",
    "Producer catalogue names with NO kind: Specialized metalworkers, Smelter, Sawmill (deliberately not a mill), Fisher's landing / Fishmonger (fish goes to food-source), Shipyard, Tannery/Tanners, Weavers, Potter, Brewer/Brewery, Glassblower, Craft guilds, Charcoal burner, Peat cutter, Beekeeper, Chandler, Apothecary/Alchemist.",
    "The Resources tab \"Economic strengths\" is fed by geographyData.js <terrain>.economicStrengths (resourceGenerator.js:500), not by RESOURCE_DATA."
  ]
